# %% [markdown]
# # The Honest Metrics of Fraud Detection: companion notebook
#
# Companion to "The Honest Metrics of Fraud Detection: Precision, Recall, and the
# Investigator Capacity Constraint".
#
# - All data is **synthetic** (seed 42). No real bank, client, or transaction data.
# - Every figure in the article is regenerated by this notebook.
